          <li><a href="#electrochemical-theory" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">2. The Electrochemical Theory of Metal Corrosion</a></li>
          <li><a href="#passivation-chemistry" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">3. Chemistry and Passivation Mechanism</a></li>
          <li><a href="#environmental-compliance" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">4. Synergistic Formulations &amp; Environmental Compliance</a></li>
